{"id":67,"title":"游园不值","dynasty":"宋","author":"叶绍翁","lines":[{"text":"应怜屐齿印苍苔，","pinyin":"yīng lián jī chǐ yìn cāng tái","chars":[{"char":"应","pinyin":"yīng"},{"char":"怜","pinyin":"lián"},{"char":"屐","pinyin":"jī"},{"char":"齿","pinyin":"chǐ"},{"char":"印","pinyin":"yìn"},{"char":"苍","pinyin":"cāng"},{"char":"苔","pinyin":"tái"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"小扣柴扉久不开。","pinyin":"xiǎo kòu chái fēi jiǔ bù kāi","chars":[{"char":"小","pinyin":"xiǎo"},{"char":"扣","pinyin":"kòu"},{"char":"柴","pinyin":"chái"},{"char":"扉","pinyin":"fēi"},{"char":"久","pinyin":"jiǔ"},{"char":"不","pinyin":"bù"},{"char":"开","pinyin":"kāi"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"春色满园关不住，","pinyin":"chūn sè mǎn yuán guān bù zhù","chars":[{"char":"春","pinyin":"chūn"},{"char":"色","pinyin":"sè"},{"char":"满","pinyin":"mǎn"},{"char":"园","pinyin":"yuán"},{"char":"关","pinyin":"guān"},{"char":"不","pinyin":"bù"},{"char":"住","pinyin":"zhù"},{"char":"，","pinyin":null}]},{"text":"一枝红杏出墙来。","pinyin":"yì zhī hóng xìng chū qiáng lái","chars":[{"char":"一","pinyin":"yì"},{"char":"枝","pinyin":"zhī"},{"char":"红","pinyin":"hóng"},{"char":"杏","pinyin":"xìng"},{"char":"出","pinyin":"chū"},{"char":"墙","pinyin":"qiáng"},{"char":"来","pinyin":"lái"},{"char":"。","pinyin":null}]}],"titlePinyin":["yóu","yuán","bù","zhí"]}